{"server":"cn","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_08_beg","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_08","title":"罗德岛大食堂","storyCode":"DT-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"87c128760b75111742be669ea61d5db92ff2e44efcbde47a2ccecd2882f06e24","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"终于登上了罗德岛的小队几人再次追上了刻俄柏，但是眼前的小刻似乎变得有些奇怪......","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汇总一下我们一路上收集的有关罗德岛的情报吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，大鲍勃和大祭司都认为罗德岛可以帮助我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，小刻也说这里有个叫作“博士”的人肯定知道怎么解决我们的问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我们这次好像终于真的接近那艘舰船了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望那里真的有能解决我们问题的方法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们快过来看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"narration","text":"在齐尔查克的招呼下，三人走到了悬崖边，那一瞬间，他们就理解了齐尔查克的语气为什么会有些焦急。\n那是一艘过于巨大的陆上舰船。\n在陆地上航行，却比他们见过的任何一艘水上船只都要庞大。\n一座钢铁巨构。一座城市。一座......迷宫。\n这就是——“罗德岛”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的是一艘在陆地行驶的舰船啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们真的能在那里找到回去的路吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，我觉得我们应该考虑的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该怎么进去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从这里我甚至看不见它的入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们看！那边好像有一支队伍在靠近罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来好像是一支商队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商队......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我们去和他们聊聊吧？看他们是否愿意带我们进去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodeslowerdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先锋干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我们回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先锋干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。对了，我们刚刚还遇到了四个来求助的人，穿着打扮都挺奇怪的，说是和刻俄柏认识，想让罗德岛帮他们回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？回家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先锋干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是这个意思，总之辛苦你给他们带一下路，我去和外勤部对接了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯小队","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们是专门来罗德岛求助的，应该是要找博士或者是阿米娅吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......小刻倒是说过“博士”，我们可能是要找这个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能带我们去见这个博士吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还需要确认下你们的身份，你们先跟我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦......！不好意思，我的东西掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《鲍勃的美食指南》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们认识大鲍勃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我们来这里吃到的第一顿饭就是他做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能把那样坚硬的虫子处理成一道道美味的食物，老夫很敬佩那个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了......原来他说的“那些朋友”就是你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫泥岩，大鲍勃和我讲过你们。当初他们刚决定不再当佣兵，想要换一个活法，但完全不知道开农场的事能不能行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒野上的农场经常会遭到洗劫，大鲍勃也不认识几个做生意的人，啤酒做出来也不知道好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们当时吃他的料理的样子很幸福，给了他不少信心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫当时并没有看出来他这样窘迫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那他现在怎么样......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，我们也很久没见过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是听说他后来源石虫啤酒厂办得很好，赚了不少钱，也过上好日子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但后来又听说好像是挣钱的时候得罪了当地政府，说是税务还是什么问题，被关进监狱里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"监狱？那他们现在还好吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前段时间又听说他们好像越狱还是保释出来了，人没什么问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越狱啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再听说到的就是他们好像在萨米开了家杂货店，生意不错呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是......很有毅力地在生活啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，先跟我来吧，我们坐电梯上去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"电梯......？就是这个铁盒子吗......？它怎么用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来也像是一个魔法器具......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们先进，我们去一层，稍等，我拿个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯小队","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么一开门全都变了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是哪里？刚刚发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么这里看起来更像是个迷宫啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是萨米的独眼巨人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"独眼巨人？！为什么齐尔查克你会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你出现在这里，该不会是因为你又看到了什么吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你们前进的道路上，有着火光、冲击......以及凶恶的兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道刻俄柏或者博士在哪里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刻俄柏刚刚回到罗德岛，现在应该在训练室，在那个方位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾尔启","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......请原谅我暂时不能告诉你什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们......要先过去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩好像已经彻底和我们走散了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是那位女士说的训练室了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里好像没什么人......那边倒是有一个好大的怪东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还愣着干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，大祭司？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，你有见到刻俄柏吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她刚才还在这里，不过已经跑走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想见到那个小家伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就别磨蹭了，赶紧都过来，坐进这台机器里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？啊......好、好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，我们得到消息，好像有走失的访客往这边来了，你有见到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？我没见过，我们正在这边做新型号大丑的抗冲击安全测试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建议你们离远一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞定，祖玛玛，准备就绪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶舱内的莱欧斯小队","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么好像看到里面有人被炸飞了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定你看到有人被炸飞了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我真的看错了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，去别的地方找吧，你要找的人不在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你这完全是公报私仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们炖了我一次，我炸他们一次，也算是礼尚往来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你把他们弄哪里去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们想要找刻俄柏，我就送他们去找刻俄柏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可没有骗他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"narration","text":"从爆炸中回过神来，四人发现自己不知何时飘在了有些眼熟的半空之中，并且开始往下坠。\n正下方，竟然是熟悉的婆山镇，而黎正用古怪的眼神看着他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯小队","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊，救命——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"四人在空中张牙舞爪却束手无策。\n不过，他们马上发现，自己的正下方，并不是地面，而是一口深不见底的井。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们并没有与地面亲密接触，而是直接摔入了井中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然方法有些粗暴，不过，她这也算是送各位一程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"有缘再会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻又跑到厨房来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这次她的样子好像有点奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——这次她回来之后变得有些沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我去和她聊聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么了，是身体不舒服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我也说不上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到本舰后，就觉得身体怪怪的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，我们去做一次全面检查好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说不上来，但是，我觉得我应该一个人待一会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......那你先去休息一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——我的屁股......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......厨房？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙击干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，站在我身后！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，大祭司把我们送到了不太好的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司？你们到底——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是小刻去休息的房间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们快去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生了什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们提到了小刻，我们也快跟去看一看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻，是你吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肚子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这到底是怎么回事？这是我们认识的小刻吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我能从她的情绪感觉到，她依然是我们认识的小刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她在克制，但是，她快要忍不住了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这是我们认识的小刻吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好帅！小刻，你原来还有这种本领！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在是说这些的时候吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得想办法救救小刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"几位客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"按你们刚才说的话，我可以理解为你们是关心小刻的状况而来到这里的，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们来这里是为了能找到回到我们那个世界的方法......但是我们也很担心小刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，眼下先让我们放下一些疑问，一起压制住小刻吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的话，事情会变得一发不可收拾的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，暂时联手吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺","森西","莱欧斯小队","驾驶舱内的莱欧斯小队","齐尔查克"]}]}
